### Import Excel File
POST http://localhost:5055/api/excel/import
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filePath": "C:\\path\\to\\your\\sample.xlsx",
  "sheetName": "Sheet1",
  "hasHeaders": true
}

### Import Excel File with Default Settings (First Sheet, Has Headers)
POST http://localhost:5055/api/excel/import
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filePath": "C:\\path\\to\\your\\sample.xlsx"
}
### Import Excel File Without Headers
POST http://localhost:5055/api/excel/import
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filePath": "C:\\path\\to\\your\\sample.xlsx",
  "hasHeaders": false
}
